{"2924670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GRODA", "steam_appid": 2924670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>FIGHT - LOOT - EXPLORE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/7d57f71eafbd40ba93b7382c2cef0e63.poster.avif?t=1771252443\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/7d57f71eafbd40ba93b7382c2cef0e63.webm?t=1771252443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/7d57f71eafbd40ba93b7382c2cef0e63.mp4?t=1771252443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Deep down in an otherworldly chasm, a frog-like creature and its weird little sidekick struggle to outrun an ominous pursuing force. Outnumbered and outmatched by relentless foes and treacherous terrain, their only choice is to fight their way upwards through a weird, chaotic abyss      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLD </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/242b642f4c8413793860891bf17674e3.poster.avif?t=1771252443\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/242b642f4c8413793860891bf17674e3.webm?t=1771252443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/242b642f4c8413793860891bf17674e3.mp4?t=1771252443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted levels that challenge your timing, skill, and nerves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several different biomes, each with unique gameplay mechanics and bosses, littered with hidden routes and secrets to uncover (some only accessible with certain traits or items)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle Rooms, Challenge Rooms, Speedrun Mode and optional challenges for those who like to keep it real (and an easier mode for those who don't) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMBAT</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/cb46fdcda9f0855437b23eca513ad259.poster.avif?t=1771252443\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/cb46fdcda9f0855437b23eca513ad259.webm?t=1771252443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/cb46fdcda9f0855437b23eca513ad259.mp4?t=1771252443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive and intense combat where you must rely on skill, cunning, and reflexes </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use upgradeable spells to blast your opponents to bits, shield yourself from projectiles or impact the environment to turn the tables on your unassuming enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo-mechanics that reward skillful  playstyles </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHOP &amp; ROGUE MECHANICS </strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/2c65fff6caa747f5567ed758980c72e9.poster.avif?t=1771252443\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/2c65fff6caa747f5567ed758980c72e9.webm?t=1771252443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/2c65fff6caa747f5567ed758980c72e9.mp4?t=1771252443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new spells, items and upgrades from the mysterious Elder Frog, who runs an interdimensional shop with randomized inventory, allowing you to craft and modify your playstyle between each level </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain permanent, otherworldly powers by defeating the main bosses   </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>FIGHT - LOOT - EXPLORE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/7d57f71eafbd40ba93b7382c2cef0e63.poster.avif?t=1771252443\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/7d57f71eafbd40ba93b7382c2cef0e63.webm?t=1771252443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/7d57f71eafbd40ba93b7382c2cef0e63.mp4?t=1771252443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Deep down in an otherworldly chasm, a frog-like creature and its weird little sidekick struggle to outrun an ominous pursuing force. Outnumbered and outmatched by relentless foes and treacherous terrain, their only choice is to fight their way upwards through a weird, chaotic abyss      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLD </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/242b642f4c8413793860891bf17674e3.poster.avif?t=1771252443\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/242b642f4c8413793860891bf17674e3.webm?t=1771252443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/242b642f4c8413793860891bf17674e3.mp4?t=1771252443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted levels that challenge your timing, skill, and nerves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several different biomes, each with unique gameplay mechanics and bosses, littered with hidden routes and secrets to uncover (some only accessible with certain traits or items)  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle Rooms, Challenge Rooms, Speedrun Mode and optional challenges for those who like to keep it real (and an easier mode for those who don't) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMBAT</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/cb46fdcda9f0855437b23eca513ad259.poster.avif?t=1771252443\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/cb46fdcda9f0855437b23eca513ad259.webm?t=1771252443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/cb46fdcda9f0855437b23eca513ad259.mp4?t=1771252443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive and intense combat where you must rely on skill, cunning, and reflexes </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use upgradeable spells to blast your opponents to bits, shield yourself from projectiles or impact the environment to turn the tables on your unassuming enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo-mechanics that reward skillful  playstyles </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SHOP &amp; ROGUE MECHANICS </strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/2c65fff6caa747f5567ed758980c72e9.poster.avif?t=1771252443\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/2c65fff6caa747f5567ed758980c72e9.webm?t=1771252443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/extras/2c65fff6caa747f5567ed758980c72e9.mp4?t=1771252443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new spells, items and upgrades from the mysterious Elder Frog, who runs an interdimensional shop with randomized inventory, allowing you to craft and modify your playstyle between each level </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain permanent, otherworldly powers by defeating the main bosses   </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "GRODA is an intense arcade experience, blending nerve-wracking action with precision platforming and rogue elements", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2924670/aa346250cfe622f0e0bace2290b9bf1ababcdc5f/header.jpg?t=1771252443", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets